@page "/components/checkbox"

<PageTitle>Checkbox — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Checkbox</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A real <code>&lt;input type="checkbox"&gt;</code>, styled. Radix draws a button with a hidden
    input beside it; on static SSR the real input is the only thing that posts and the only thing
    that can be focused, so it stays and the tick is a mask on its own <code>::after</code>.
</p>

