<h2 class="doc-h2">Checked State</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Three states, and the third is the platform's: <code>indeterminate</code> is a DOM property
    rather than an attribute, which is why a parent box whose children disagree is set by a
    compiler and not by markup.
</p>
