<h2 class="doc-h2">Group</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Several boxes with one name post a list, which is how HTML has always done it. The
    <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code> is what names the group — without it a screen reader announces
    three unrelated checkboxes.
</p>
